    "gp_section_633287113768698453": {
      "settings": {
        "checksum": "a22430483c0a658d50ce96a25dafad5b473298cbc32a004113845427ecbdeceb_1_1_1_0__1",
        "gg13DkAKWzH_srcSet_desktop_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/files/English_1.png",
        "gg2kcpiQdtX_srcSet_desktop_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/files/Articles_4.gif",
        "gg62-SJsX0F_srcSet_desktop_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/files/Articles_-_2026-08-19T114133.412.png",
        "gg6ngMYFvZv_text": "<p><strong>STEP 2: </strong>Open ThePhotoStick Omni app.</p>",
        "gg8Pv9VtE3K_text": "<p><strong>How Does </strong><a href=\"https://track.thephotostickquiz.com/action/1\"><strong><u>ThePhotoStick Omni</u></strong></a><strong> Work?</strong></p>",
        "gg9P_6hbE0S_text": "<span style=\"color:#FFFFFF;\">UPDATE: How to Find the Best Price for ThePhotoStick Omni</span>",
        "ggAFvi7tmsK_text": "<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#3D3D3D;\">No need to worry about me. There are PLENTY of other tech repair issues that I can help people with. (My business will be fine.)</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#3D3D3D;\">If there’s something out there that can EASILY prevent the heart-wrenching phone call I have to make every time I can’t recover someone’s cherished memories from their phone or computer that crashed, it gets my endorsement.</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#3D3D3D;\"><strong>I would much rather live in a world where everyone backs up their precious memories before it’s too late… </strong>allowing me to focus on customers I know I can make happy!</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#3D3D3D;\">And now that ThePhotoStick Omni exists, everyone—regardless of their tech-savviness—has an easy way to get the job done in a few minutes.</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#3D3D3D;\">So, what can I say? My friend was right. <strong>ThePhotoStick Omni simply does the job better than I could…</strong> in less time. I absolutely recommend it!</span></p>",
        "ggE1CRaGO1n_srcSet_desktop_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/files/Articles_-_2026-07-13T112556.339.png",
        "ggE7WjqvSdH_srcSet_desktop_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/files/Articles_-_2026-08-19T114059.332.png",
        "ggEpH-rYk-J_text": "<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#3D3D3D;\"><strong>It’s called </strong></span><a href=\"https://track.thephotostickquiz.com/action/1\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#3D3D3D;\"><strong><u>ThePhotoStick Omni</u></strong></span></a><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#3D3D3D;\"><strong>.</strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#3D3D3D;\">It’s a revolutionary device that automatically <strong>finds, sorts, and saves up to 200,000 photos and videos across ANY of your devices</strong> with just ONE click.</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#3D3D3D;\">Even better, you only need one of them for all your devices! ThePhotoStick Omni works on:</span></p><p><br><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#3D3D3D;\"><strong>• </strong>All Windows computers</span><br><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#3D3D3D;\"><strong>• </strong>All Mac (Apple) computers</span><br><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#3D3D3D;\"><strong>• </strong>All smartphones (iPhones, Android, iOS, etc.)</span><br><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#3D3D3D;\"><strong>• </strong>All tablets (Galaxy, iPad, etc.)</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#3D3D3D;\">This means you can now safely store, access, and share ALL of your precious photo and video memories in a matter of minutes… no matter where they are… with ONE device. It’s going to prevent so many irreplaceable photos &amp; videos from being lost!</span></p>",
        "ggG0tXS5C2P_srcSet_desktop_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/files/English_2.png",
        "ggGTbMUEkXW_text": "<p><strong>Sharing with ThePhotoStick Omni is easy!</strong> Just select the photo you'd like to share...</p>",
        "ggI_cvq8Qt2_text": "<p><strong>Bottom Line: If You’d Like To Keep All Your Photo &amp; Video Memories Safe, You Need ThePhotoStick Omni!</strong></p>",
        "ggLVKR7Sf83_text": "<p><strong>As of August 19, 2026,</strong> it looks like they’re still offering a <strong>deep discount</strong> on ThePhotoStick Omni in various storage sizes directly on their website. (Click below now—I don’t know how long this discount will last.)</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>TECH GUY TIP: </strong>I always buy the biggest storage size with backup solutions like this. That way, you never have to worry about maxing out your thumb drive and going without backing up for a few weeks…or storing files across multiple drives and having to keep them organized. Not fun! And if you don’t like ThePhotoStick Omni when you use it for the first time, just send it back and ask for a refund. No harm done.</p>",
        "ggOkdey7h96_text": "<p>That’s millions of precious memories… lost forever.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>To recover them, you either have to figure it out on your own… or pay a technician like me $300 - $500 with no guarantees!</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I get dozens of calls for this every week… and very few end well.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>So naturally, I was MORE than a bit skeptical when my friend called to say he had found <strong>a one-of-a-kind gadget that does all your backups FOR YOU… on ALL your devices…</strong> and it saves them in ONE secure physical location.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>It sounded unbelievable. I had seen my fair share of flimsy thumb drives and “unhackable” cloud-based services—that just get hacked 2 weeks later.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>But, I decided to test out this new device anyway… mostly to make my friend happy.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>And I was SHOCKED when I discovered that it <strong>ACTUALLY WORKS — and it’s both SECURE &amp; EASY</strong> to use. Let me explain…</p>",
        "ggQ5Dp_czZe_text": "<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#3D3D3D;\">…and send it directly to a loved one to open on the device of their choosing.</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"https://track.thephotostickquiz.com/action/1\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#3D3D3D;\"><strong><u>ThePhotoStick Omni</u></strong></span></a><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#3D3D3D;\"> is NOT like any other thumb drive you’ve seen out there.</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#3D3D3D;\">Not only does this device help you store ALL of your photos, videos, audio files, and documents in ONE easily accessible place…</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#3D3D3D;\">ThePhotoStick Omni actually comes with a companion app that automatically <strong>organizes your files so that it’s FAST AND EASY to find what you’re looking for.</strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#3D3D3D;\">Want to show off your adorable grandbaby taking her first steps to your friends at church? It takes just 30 seconds with ThePhotoStick Omni!</span></p>",
        "ggQegUKjj5w_srcSet_desktop_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/files/Articles_-_2026-08-19T114159.287.png",
        "ggRuifBZyM__srcSet_desktop_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/files/Articles_-_2026-08-17T155657.125.png",
        "ggVPSVfIsqo_text": "<p>This is where I was pleasantly surprised. <strong>Most backup systems are WAY too complicated for the average user… which results in a lot of tragic mistakes.</strong><br><br>Not only do backups take a LONG time, <strong>one little mistake can cause all those precious memories to be erased.</strong> And digging through your folders to find all those files is always a nightmare… you’ll never know if you missed an important photo or video until it’s too late.<br><br>But that’s what makes ThePhotoStick Omni different. It does everything FOR YOU in just 3 simple steps:<br><br><strong>STEP 1:</strong> Plug the stick into ANY device that has your photos or videos.</p>",
        "ggVuiYyCpKI_text": "<p><strong>NOTE: </strong>It comes with a universal attachment that will fit onto any computer, phone, or tablet – even if it doesn’t have a USB slot.</p>",
        "ggWx5d04050_srcSet_desktop_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/files/Articles_-_2026-08-19T114025.161.png",
        "ggYsWsb_YNK_srcSet_desktop_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/files/Articles_-_2026-08-19T113955.367.png",
        "ggZQYMQigL1_text": "<p>In the time it takes to walk your dog, <a href=\"https://track.thephotostickquiz.com/action/1\"><strong><u>ThePhotoStick Omni</u></strong></a> will scan every inch of your device to find each and every irreplaceable photo or video, and automatically back up ALL your precious memories.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Even better, it will <strong>automatically remove any duplicate files — saving you time while maximizing the storage space on your devices.</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Doing this on your own would take you HOURS… and HOURS… and HOURS. And without ThePhotoStick Omni, there’s no guarantee that you’ll find everything — it’s so easy to miss files hidden on your computer!</p>",
        "ggaLjpcMARz_text": "<p><strong>What Is This New Easy-to-Use Backup Gadget?</strong></p>",
        "ggal0Qhp1hI_text": "<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#3D3D3D;\">Dying to show your kids the jaw-dropping sights from your Alaskan cruise? ThePhotoStick Omni makes it quick and easy!</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#3D3D3D;\">And if for any reason you DON’T find ThePhotoStick Omni incredibly easy to use, they offer live chat with their dedicated support team if you need help—INCLUDED in the price of the stick!</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#3D3D3D;\">All this for <strong>far, far, FAR less than the cost of that “cloud-based” backup service</strong> that charges you month after month, year after year… or paying hundreds to try to retrieve your memories from a fried hard drive or busted phone.</span></p>",
        "ggc--QTdbCv_text": "<p>Here’s another feature I found to be really helpful: ThePhotoStick Omni will actually find and protect MORE than just photos and videos.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>It also backs up documents, voice memos, and music files—over 100 different file types</strong>—and helps you organize them all into folders on the stick.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Bonus:</strong> This makes it so easy to fix that dreaded “Storage At Maximum Capacity. Please delete files to make room.” pop-up message. Just plug in ThePhotoStick Omni and you’re good to go!</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>PLUS… ThePhotoStick Omni isn’t ONLY useful when it comes to backing up your photos.</p>",
        "ggi_buXeFFq_text": "<p><strong>You’ll Also Save HOURS of Time When You Want to Find Some Photos To Share With Friends &amp; Family</strong></p>",
        "ggkBY88em1h_text": "<p><strong>Even Better: </strong><a href=\"https://track.thephotostickquiz.com/action/1?vid=fd9NBbIVy5w7B2QZaQHEMg013x&amp;rn=1IFt19i0BscH&amp;rf=1IFstnQONx6l\"><strong>ThePhotoStick Omni</strong></a><strong> Works On ALL Files!</strong></p>",
        "ggpah84uQ0b_text": "<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#D10808;\">Do you have a lot of photos and videos stored on your computer and/or phone? Read this article closely… it could prevent a tragedy!</span></p>",
        "ggsaO2WdDXM_text": "<p><strong>STEP 3: </strong>Tap \"BACKUP FILES NOW\"</p>",
        "ggsltTeS5nJ_label": "<p>Check Available Discount Now!</p>",
        "gguhFSlhOQE_text": "<p>As a computer repair technician, I get desperate phone calls from customers every day.<br><br>They usually sound something like this:<br><br><i>“PLEASE help me! I put my phone on the hood of the car for one second and forgot about it when I drove away. <strong>Now it won’t turn on… and I have YEARS of family photos on there.”</strong></i><br><br>Or… “<i>I don’t know what happened. I was on my computer playing solitaire when <strong>the screen suddenly turned black…</strong> I’m afraid to touch it. I JUST moved my vacation photos with my grandchildren to my computer and deleted them off my phone… is there any hope?”</i><br><br>Of course, <strong>I tell all my customers to “ALWAYS BACK UP” – but hardly any of them do.</strong> And honestly, I understand why – it takes a TON of effort to back up all your most important files!<br><br>First, you have to dig through all those folders across ALL your devices… then organize all your photos and videos… and then you have to go through each file and figure out which ones you’re going to back up, removing the duplicates you’ve already backed up in the past. You can easily spend hundreds of hours going through everything!<br><br>We’d all rather spend our free time doing just about anything else. But get this: <strong>140,000 hard drives crash EVERY WEEK in the United States alone…</strong><br><br>And as a result, about <strong>46% of internet users lose their files every year.</strong></p>",
